# SEC Fundamentals Warehouse - Massachusetts public companies

Where does return on equity come from for ${companies} Massachusetts public companies? A DuckDB star schema built from SEC XBRL says three places: ${t1} through leverage (${t1_roe} ROE, ${t1_em}x equity multiplier), ${t2} through asset turnover (${t2_at}x), ${bm} through margin (${bm_nm}).

